  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She stops Fang Yuan outside the turbulent flow sea area and asks him, under the Chu Ying identity, to report any tributary of the River of Time for Miao Ming Shen. Narration places her as a transformation path Gu Immortal from Eastern Sea with rank six cultivation who has passed two heavenly tribulations, and as one of Miao Ming Shen’s followers beside Feng Jiang and Gui Qi Ye.",
      "chapters": [
        1154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_tributary_of_the_river_of_time",
        "char_miao_ming_shen",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_feng_jiang",
        "char_gui_qi_ye"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She wears a light pink raiment with fluttering sleeves. Her eyes are clear and shiny, and she is extremely beautiful, with tender pink lips and pearl-like teeth.",
      "chapters": [
        1154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "With Gui Qi Ye and Feng Jiang she takes turns guarding the turbulent flow sea area and asking approaching Gu Immortals for help. She warns Chu Ying about the blood path demonic immortal Ding Qi after leaving, using an information path mortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "turbulent-flow-sea-watch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ding_qi",
        "sys_information_path_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Days later she inspects a recent tributary trace Fang Yuan provides, feels overjoyed after decades of fruitless search, and finally has good news for Miao Ming Shen.",
      "chapters": [
        1159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-of-time-clue",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later finds her and Feng Jiang pursued by an enemy, helps them under the Chu Ying identity, and follows them to meet Miao Ming Shen for a trading convention. At the convention she and Feng Jiang are present but leave to guard when trading begins.",
      "chapters": [
        1295
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pursuit-and-trading-convention",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She remains among the three Eastern Sea lone immortals who look to Miao Ming Shen as leader. After Ren Xiu Ping’s ice poison starfish trap she stands injured beside Miao Ming Shen and worries for Gui Qi Ye.",
      "chapters": [
        1648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "miao-ming-shen-circle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ren_xiu_ping"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Miao Ming Shen lists her among the eight on the blue dragon whale trip and among those he trusts most with Gui Qi Ye and Feng Jiang.",
      "chapters": [
        1650
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blue-dragon-whale-trip",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
